  "business_rules": [
    "Deleted records (is_deleted = 1) should normally be excluded from reporting.",
    "created_date is the preferred date column for period-based reporting.",
    "Use current_stock for monetary or quantity totals.",
    "Columns minimum_stock_level classify the record; check the distinct values before filtering on them.",
    "Join to Factories, Factory Products, Stores, Users through the foreign key columns to resolve names.",
    "Stock is defined in the EF Core model but was not found in the connected database, so it may not be deployed there."
